# Server

- Parse every external input with Zod. Use the inferred type as the function argument.
- Route handlers and Server Actions call a service in `src/server`. They do not call Prisma and they do not encode business rules.
- Only `src/server/db` constructs the Prisma client.
- Check the session and role at the start of every mutation and every non-public read.
- Public project reads go through a serializer that returns the public card fields only.
- Return a typed error (`code` + `message`). Do not leak SQL, stack traces, or internal ids in the message.

```ts
const input = createProjectInput.parse(body);
const project = await createProject({ userId: session.user.id, input });
return Response.json(project);
```
